    {
      "subId": "39702",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Diluc",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "3970201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "3970201": {
            "id": "3970201",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Diluc",
            "text": "The Abyss Order... Enemies of the human race. Even the underground networks rarely come across any information on them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3970202"
            ]
          },
          "3970202": {
            "id": "3970202",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Diluc",
            "text": "With that said, it was a bit of a hassle, but I managed to dig up a few clues.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3970203"
            ]
          },
          "3970203": {
            "id": "3970203",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "Really? That quickly? You really are well connected, Master Diluc.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3970204"
            ]
          },
          "3970204": {
            "id": "3970204",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Come to think of it, Mr. Big Anemo God Barbatos — why exactly do you need the help of mere humans...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3970205"
            ]
          },
          "3970205": {
            "id": "3970205",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "Ahh... How do I put it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3970206"
            ]
          },
          "3970206": {
            "id": "3970206",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "\"The Seven\" as people now know them, were once known as \"The Seven Archons.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3970207"
            ]
          },
          "3970207": {
            "id": "3970207",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "Each archon presides over their own part of Teyvat. That is the role the archons play.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3970208"
            ]
          },
          "3970208": {
            "id": "3970208",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "Only in performing this duty can we attain power, but I don't like the idea of \"ruling\" Mondstadt — and I don't feel Mondstadt would really like it either.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3970209"
            ]
          },
          "3970209": {
            "id": "3970209",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "\"Go forth and establish a city of freedom without rule.\" We have not forgotten Barbatos' wish for Mondstadt.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3970210"
            ]
          },
          "3970210": {
            "id": "3970210",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Jean... You're such a devotee!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3970211"
            ]
          },
          "3970211": {
            "id": "3970211",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Maybe someone got a little too free and is just too lazy to care...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3970212"
            ]
          },
          "3970212": {
            "id": "3970212",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "Ahh... However it may have come to be... I haven't been back to Mondstadt for an extended period of time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3970213"
            ]
          },
          "3970213": {
            "id": "3970213",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "Without a doubt, I am now the weakest archon among The Seven!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3970216"
            ]
          },
          "3970216": {
            "id": "3970216",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "Aww, you flatter me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3970217"
            ]
          },
          "3970217": {
            "id": "3970217",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Diluc",
            "text": "Oh, such a humble god... Is it a blessing, or a curse?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3970218"
            ]
          },
          "3970218": {
            "id": "3970218",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Diluc",
            "text": "But we digress. Let's get back to the topic at hand: the common enemy of all mankind.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3970219"
            ]
          },
          "3970219": {
            "id": "3970219",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Diluc",
            "text": "We have tracked the <color=#00E1FFFF>Abyss Mage</color> to the vicinity of the <color=#00E1FFFF>winery</color>.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3970220"
            ]
          },
          "3970220": {
            "id": "3970220",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "I cannot stress enough how important it is to not let it escape.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3970221"
            ]
          },
          "3970221": {
            "id": "3970221",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Let's hunt it down!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "39703",
      "subQuestName": "Defeat the assailants",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "3970301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "3970301": {
            "id": "3970301",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "There it is!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "39704",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Venti",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "3970401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "3970401": {
            "id": "3970401",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "Huh? What's this...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3970402"
            ]
          },
          "3970402": {
            "id": "3970402",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "After the Abyss Mage was defeated, a certain energy dispersed from its body...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3970403"
            ]
          },
          "3970403": {
            "id": "3970403",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "It seems that energy was being used to cut off the connection between me and Dvalin.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3970404"
            ]
          },
          "3970404": {
            "id": "3970404",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3970405"
            ]
          },
          "3970405": {
            "id": "3970405",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "#{NICKNAME}, do you know of <color=#00E1FFFF>Stormterror's Lair</color>?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3970407",
              "3970409"
            ]
          },
          "3970407": {
            "id": "3970407",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "But Jean and Master Diluc are no doubt aware of it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3970410"
            ]
          },
          "3970410": {
            "id": "3970410",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "After Dvalin woke up, he took the ancient ruins as his lair.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3970411"
            ]
          },
          "3970411": {
            "id": "3970411",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "As it was with the storms that previously cut Mondstadt off from the outside world, the entrance to the ruins is also sealed by a special barrier.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3970412"
            ]
          },
          "3970412": {
            "id": "3970412",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "But now, as the energy dispersed from the Abyss Mage, I was able to read the rhythmic flow of how the barrier's magic was woven.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3970413"
            ]
          },
          "3970413": {
            "id": "3970413",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "I must admit, it sounds even more horrendous than a chorus of hilichurls, but...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3970414"
            ]
          },
          "3970414": {
            "id": "3970414",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "...It should be enough to let us break through the storm barrier and reach <color=#00E1FFFF>Stormterror's Lair</color>.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3970415"
            ]
          },
          "3970415": {
            "id": "3970415",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Diluc",
            "text": "Which means we're going to confront Dvalin?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3970416"
            ]
          },
          "3970416": {
            "id": "3970416",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Diluc",
            "text": "I'm fine with that... Jean is the one who wishes to avoid any direct confrontation.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3970417"
            ]
          },
          "3970417": {
            "id": "3970417",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "No. When there are no other options left, it is my responsibility to alter our course of action.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3970418"
            ]
          },
          "3970418": {
            "id": "3970418",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "If slaying him is our only choice, I will gladly become the knight that leads the charge.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3970419"
            ]
          },
          "3970419": {
            "id": "3970419",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "Fortunately, we have yet to need to go that far.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3970420"
            ]
          },
          "3970420": {
            "id": "3970420",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Diluc",
            "text": "Hmm?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3970421"
            ]
          },
          "3970421": {
            "id": "3970421",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "By that, you mean...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3970422"
            ]
          },
          "3970422": {
            "id": "3970422",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "I mean that the Holy Lyre is not our trump card.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3970423"
            ]
          },
          "3970423": {
            "id": "3970423",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "#Our real trump card? {NICKNAME} of course.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3970424"
            ]
          },
          "3970424": {
            "id": "3970424",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#{NICKNAME}?"
          },
          "3970409": {
            "id": "3970409",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "Of course. I believe the people of Mondstadt all know of it."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}